---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TourCard from '../components/TourCard.astro';
import ContactPanel from '../components/ContactPanel.astro';

const featuredIds = [
  'bordeaux-wine-food-history-walk',
  'bordeaux-treasure-hunt-1453',
  'dieppe-scallops-seafood',
  'dieppe-castle-1942-history',
];
const all = await getCollection('tours');
const featured = featuredIds
  .map((id) => all.find((t) => t.id === id))
  .filter((t): t is NonNullable<typeof t> => Boolean(t));

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'LocalBusiness',
  name: 'Savor & Stories',
  telephone: '+33626391783',
  email: 'contact@savornstories.com',
  url: 'https://savorstories.com',
  areaServed: ['Bordeaux', 'Dieppe'],
};

const tag = 'bg-linen/90 text-ink text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase px-3 py-2 rounded-full';
---
<Layout
  title="Savor & Stories | Private Tours in Bordeaux & Dieppe with Antoine"
  description="Authentic French experiences, told by locals. Private wine, food and history tours in Bordeaux and Dieppe with Antoine."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 pt-12 md:pt-24 pb-10 md:pb-20 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-10 md:gap-16">
    <div class="flex-[1_1_440px] min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-7">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 eyebrow">
        <span class="inline-block w-9 h-px bg-terracotta" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span data-lang="en">Private tours in Bordeaux and Dieppe</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Visites privées à Bordeaux et à Dieppe</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Tours privados en Burdeos y Dieppe</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-[44px] md:text-[68px] lg:text-[76px] leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-ink">
        <span data-lang="en">Authentic French experiences, told by locals</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Des expériences françaises authentiques, racontées par des locaux</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Experiencias francesas auténticas, contadas por locales</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft max-w-[56ch]">
        <span data-lang="en">I'm Antoine, and these are the two French towns I actually know inside out. Bordeaux gave the world its wine trade and two thousand years of history to go with it. Dieppe gave me something quieter: a working scallop port, chalk cliffs, and a castle above the beach.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Je m'appelle Antoine, et voici les deux villes françaises que je connais vraiment par cœur. Bordeaux a donné au monde son commerce du vin et deux mille ans d'histoire avec. Dieppe m'a donné quelque chose de plus tranquille&nbsp;: un port de pêche à la coquille Saint-Jacques en activité, des falaises de craie, et un château au dessus de la plage.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Soy Antoine, y estas son las dos ciudades francesas que realmente conozco a fondo. Burdeos le dio al mundo su comercio del vino y dos mil años de historia junto con él. Dieppe me dio algo más tranquilo: un puerto pesquero de vieiras en activo, acantilados de creta, y un castillo sobre la playa.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="font-display italic text-2xl leading-snug text-ink max-w-[44ch]">
        <span data-lang="en">Pick a city and I'll show you around myself.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Choisissez une ville et je vous ferai visiter moi même.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Elige una ciudad y te la mostraré yo mismo.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5 mt-1">
        <a href="/bordeaux" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-wine hover:bg-[#4f1222] text-linen px-6 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-[15px] no-underline transition-colors">
          <span data-lang="en">Explore Bordeaux</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Découvrir Bordeaux</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Descubrir Burdeos</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/dieppe" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 border-[1.5px] border-ink text-ink hover:bg-ink hover:text-linen px-6 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-[15px] no-underline transition-colors">
          <span data-lang="en">Explore Dieppe</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Découvrir Dieppe</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Descubrir Dieppe</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-2 mt-2 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-terracotta tracking-[0.1em]">★★★★★</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Hundreds of five star reviews</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Des centaines d'avis cinq étoiles</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Cientos de reseñas de cinco estrellas</span>
        </span>
        <span>
          <span data-lang="en">Small groups only</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Petits groupes uniquement</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Solo grupos pequeños</span>
        </span>
        <span>EN · FR · ES</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-[1_1_380px] min-w-0 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-12 aspect-[1/1.08] max-w-full relative">
      <div class="zoom col-[1/11] row-[1/11] rounded-[24px_24px_24px_120px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(42,37,34,0.18)]">
        <img src="/assets/photos/antoine-portrait-explaining.jpg" alt="Antoine talking with guests in the streets of Bordeaux" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[50%_20%]" />
      </div>
      <div class="zoom col-[7/13] row-[7/13] rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden border-[6px] border-linen shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(42,37,34,0.18)]">
        <img src="/assets/photos/antoine-walking-cobblestones.jpg" alt="Antoine walking on the cobblestones of old Bordeaux" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="col-[1/6] row-[11/13] self-end bg-charcoal text-linen rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 flex flex-col gap-0.5 shadow-[0_16px_32px_rgba(42,37,34,0.2)]">
        <span class="font-display italic text-[22px] leading-none">Antoine</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-gold">
          <span data-lang="en">Your guide, in person</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Votre guide, en personne</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Tu guía, en persona</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Destinations -->
  <section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 flex flex-col gap-9">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <span class="eyebrow">
          <span data-lang="en">Choose your city</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Choisissez votre ville</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Elige tu ciudad</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-[34px] md:text-[52px] leading-[1.05] text-ink">
          <span data-lang="en">Two towns, one guide who lives in both</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Deux villes, un guide qui vit dans les deux</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Dos ciudades, un guía que vive en ambas</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-[40ch] text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
        <span data-lang="en">Each tour is led by me personally, in English, French or Spanish, and every booking goes straight through to my phone.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Chaque visite est menée par moi personnellement, en français, en anglais ou en espagnol, et chaque réservation arrive directement sur mon téléphone.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Cada tour lo guío yo personalmente, en español, inglés o francés, y cada reserva llega directamente a mi teléfono.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-7">
      <a href="/bordeaux" class="zoom lift relative block min-h-[440px] md:min-h-[560px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden text-linen no-underline shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(42,37,34,0.12)]">
        <img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-miroir-deau.jpg" alt="Place de la Bourse reflected in the Miroir d'eau, Bordeaux" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal/0 via-charcoal/0 to-charcoal/85" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class={tag}><span data-lang="en">Wine</span><span data-lang="fr" hidden>Vin</span><span data-lang="es" hidden>Vino</span></span>
          <span class={tag}><span data-lang="en">History</span><span data-lang="fr" hidden>Histoire</span><span data-lang="es" hidden>Historia</span></span>
          <span class={tag}><span data-lang="en">Bike</span><span data-lang="fr" hidden>Vélo</span><span data-lang="es" hidden>Bici</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-gold font-bold">
            <span data-lang="en">South West France</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Sud Ouest de la France</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Suroeste de Francia</span>
          </span>
          <span class="font-display font-medium text-[44px] md:text-[52px] leading-none">Bordeaux</span>
          <span class="text-base leading-relaxed text-linen/90 max-w-[42ch]">
            <span data-lang="en">Wine, food, history and a bike ride along the Garonne.</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Vin, gastronomie, histoire et une balade à vélo le long de la Garonne.</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Vino, gastronomía, historia y un paseo en bicicleta junto al Garona.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-2 font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <span data-lang="en">Explore the tours</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Voir les visites</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Ver los tours</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/dieppe" class="zoom lift relative block min-h-[440px] md:min-h-[560px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden text-linen no-underline shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(42,37,34,0.12)]">
        <img src="/assets/photos/dieppe-castle.jpg" alt="The castle of Dieppe above the beach" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal/0 via-charcoal/0 to-charcoal/85" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class={tag}><span data-lang="en">Scallops</span><span data-lang="fr" hidden>Coquilles</span><span data-lang="es" hidden>Vieiras</span></span>
          <span class={tag}><span data-lang="en">Cliffs</span><span data-lang="fr" hidden>Falaises</span><span data-lang="es" hidden>Acantilados</span></span>
          <span class={tag}>1942</span>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-gold font-bold">
            <span data-lang="en">Normandy</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Normandie</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Normandía</span>
          </span>
          <span class="font-display font-medium text-[44px] md:text-[52px] leading-none">Dieppe</span>
          <span class="text-base leading-relaxed text-linen/90 max-w-[42ch]">
            <span data-lang="en">Scallops, a clifftop castle and the story of 1942.</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Coquilles Saint-Jacques, un château sur la falaise et l'histoire de 1942.</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Vieiras, un castillo en el acantilado y la historia de 1942.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-2 font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <span data-lang="en">Explore the tours</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Voir les visites</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Ver los tours</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section id="about" class="bg-charcoal text-linen mt-6 md:mt-14">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-14 md:py-24 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-10 md:gap-24">
      <div class="flex-[1_1_460px] min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-7">
        <span class="eyebrow text-gold">
          <span data-lang="en">How I work</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Ma façon de faire</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Cómo trabajo</span>
        </span>
        <blockquote class="font-display font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.15] text-linen">
          <span class="text-terracotta text-[1.3em] leading-none align-[-0.2em]" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
          <span data-lang="en">I keep every group small on purpose. Ask me anything along the way and I'll actually answer it.</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Je garde volontairement chaque groupe petit. Posez moi n'importe quelle question en chemin, j'y répondrai vraiment.</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Mantengo cada grupo pequeño a propósito. Pregúntame lo que quieras por el camino, te responderé de verdad.</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta text-[1.3em] leading-none align-[-0.2em]" aria-hidden="true">”</span>
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <svg width="150" height="54" viewBox="0 0 150 54" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 40c10-26 18-32 22-30 4 2-6 20-2 22 5 2 12-14 18-14 5 0 2 12 7 12 6 0 12-16 17-16 4 0 1 10 6 10 6 0 13-18 20-18 5 0 0 14 6 14 5 0 10-12 17-12 6 0 4 10 10 10 6 0 11-9 21-10" stroke="#E8C07A" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          <span class="font-display italic text-[28px]">Antoine</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-[1_1_380px] min-w-0 grid gap-4">
        <div class="border border-linen/15 rounded-[18px] px-6 py-6 flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="font-display text-[34px] text-gold leading-none min-w-9">01</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <span class="font-bold text-[17px]">
              <span data-lang="en">Small groups only</span>
              <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Petits groupes uniquement</span>
              <span data-lang="es" hidden>Solo grupos pequeños</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-linen/80">
              <span data-lang="en">I want it to feel like a real conversation, not a lecture with headsets.</span>
              <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Je veux que ça ressemble à une vraie conversation, pas à une conférence avec des casques.</span>
              <span data-lang="es" hidden>Quiero que se sienta como una conversación real, no una conferencia con auriculares.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-linen/15 rounded-[18px] px-6 py-6 flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="font-display text-[34px] text-gold leading-none min-w-9">02</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <span class="font-bold text-[17px]">
              <span data-lang="en">Ask me anything</span>
              <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Posez moi vos questions</span>
              <span data-lang="es" hidden>Pregúntame lo que quieras</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-linen/80">
              <span data-lang="en">Ask me something I don't know, and I'll simply tell you so, honestly.</span>
              <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Posez moi une question à laquelle je n'ai pas la réponse, et je vous le dirai simplement, honnêtement.</span>
              <span data-lang="es" hidden>Pregúntame algo que no sepa, y simplemente te lo diré, con honestidad.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-linen/15 rounded-[18px] px-6 py-6 flex gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="font-display text-[34px] text-gold leading-none min-w-9">03</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <span class="font-bold text-[17px]">
              <span data-lang="en">Places I actually eat at</span>
              <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Des adresses où je mange moi même</span>
              <span data-lang="es" hidden>Sitios donde yo mismo como</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-linen/80">
              <span data-lang="en">Years in both towns, eating in the same handful of places, paying attention to which stories make people stop and listen.</span>
              <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Des années dans les deux villes, à manger dans les mêmes quelques endroits, à observer quelles histoires font vraiment s'arrêter les gens pour écouter.</span>
              <span data-lang="es" hidden>Años en las dos ciudades, comiendo en los mismos pocos sitios, fijándome en qué historias hacen que la gente se detenga a escuchar.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo showcase -->
  <section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 pt-14 md:pt-24 pb-6 md:pb-12 flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <span class="eyebrow">
          <span data-lang="en">Real tours, real guests</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Vraies visites, vrais clients</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Tours reales, clientes reales</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-[34px] md:text-[52px] leading-[1.05] text-ink">
          <span data-lang="en">What a day with me looks like</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>À quoi ressemble une journée avec moi</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Cómo es un día conmigo</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-[40ch] text-ink-soft text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
        <span data-lang="en">Real photos from real tours, not stock images.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>De vraies photos de vraies visites, pas des images de banque.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Fotos reales de tours reales, no imágenes de stock.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 auto-rows-[160px] md:auto-rows-[220px] grid-flow-dense gap-3 md:gap-4">
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl col-span-2 row-span-2"><img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-petanque-riverside.jpg" alt="Pétanque by the river in Bordeaux" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl"><img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-canele-box.jpg" alt="A box of fresh canelés" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl"><img src="/assets/photos/dieppe-scallops-boat.jpg" alt="A scallop boat in Dieppe harbour" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl row-span-2"><img src="/assets/photos/dieppe-cliffs-walk.jpg" alt="The chalk cliffs west of Dieppe" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl"><img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-wine-bottles.jpg" alt="Bordeaux wines lined up for a tasting" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl col-span-2"><img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-church-gesture-group.jpg" alt="Antoine with a group in front of a Bordeaux church" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl"><img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-bike-riverside.jpg" alt="Riding along the Garonne" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl"><img src="/assets/photos/dieppe-market-cheese.jpg" alt="Norman cheese at the Dieppe market" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
      <div class="zoom rounded-2xl"><img src="/assets/photos/antoine-portrait-chocolate-shop.jpg" alt="Antoine in a Bordeaux chocolate shop" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[50%_30%]" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured tours -->
  <section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-10 md:py-16 flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
      <span class="eyebrow">
        <span data-lang="en">Most booked</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Les plus réservées</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Los más reservados</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-[34px] md:text-[52px] leading-[1.05] text-ink">
        <span data-lang="en">Start here</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Commencez ici</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Empieza aquí</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
      {featured.map((tour) => (
        <TourCard
          slug={tour.id}
          icon={tour.data.icon}
          title={tour.data.title}
          summary={tour.data.summary}
          duration={tour.data.duration}
          price={tour.data.price}
          priceLabel={tour.data.priceLabel}
          heroImage={tour.data.heroImage}
          accent={tour.data.city}
          showCity
        />
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reviews -->
  <section class="bg-parchment">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-14 md:py-24 flex flex-col gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="eyebrow">
          <span data-lang="en">Guests</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Clients</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Clientes</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-[34px] md:text-[52px] leading-[1.05] text-ink">
          <span data-lang="en">What guests have said</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Ce que les clients ont dit</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Lo que han dicho los clientes</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-[56ch] text-ink-soft text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          <span data-lang="en">Real TripAdvisor reviews from Antoine's food tours before Savor &amp; Stories existed, kept exactly as guests wrote them.</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>De vrais avis TripAdvisor des visites gourmandes d'Antoine avant que Savor &amp; Stories existe, conservés exactement tels que les clients les ont écrits.</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Reseñas reales de TripAdvisor de los tours gastronómicos de Antoine antes de que existiera Savor &amp; Stories, conservadas exactamente como las escribieron los clientes.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
